# Damgil Design Language

Travel diary app. Visual direction: **minimal analog notebook**, not a dashboard.

## Do

- Light gray canvas (`#F2F2F2`), black/white high contrast, quiet spacing
- Hero moments: black rounded stage + white paper + masking-tape motif when empty/storytelling
- Screen titles: bold sans; in-notebook copy: monospace (Courier / monospace)
- Accent sparingly — active tab blue (`#2F6BFF`) only; primary actions = black buttons
- Floating pill bottom tabs; circular `+` FAB for create
- Style with `StyleSheet` + tokens in `src/theme/` (`colors`, `spacing`, `typography`, `radii`)

## Don't

- Purple/indigo gradients, neon glow, cream+serif+terracotta AI defaults
- Dark mode as default, badge/chip clusters, stat strips, card grids in hero
- Generic Inter-like “startup SaaS” look or dense newspaper layouts

## Continuity

New screens (Search, My Page, diary create, settings) must feel like the same product as Home empty state: paper, ink, tape, calm whitespace.
